 "question": "No family in this pipeline builds a page for a REGION, yet 3,865 admin1 regions and 47,643 admin2 counties sit in the gazetteer unused, and the parent polygon layer holds thousands more named geographies. Which region-scoped shapes have demand, in which market, and at which level of the hierarchy?",
 "floor": 100,
 "the_two_findings_that_decide_the_build": [
  "REGIONS YES, COUNTIES NO. Every county-level keyword tested is at or near zero: landkreis miesbach sehenswuerdigkeiten 0, provinz florenz 0, provinz siena 10, siena province 20, things to do in county kerry 30, bezirke tirol 10. Against andalusien sehenswuerdigkeiten 2,200, allgaeu 2,100, umbria cosa vedere 7,800. So 3,865 admin1 regions are in play and 47,643 admin2 counties are not, and that is 48,000 pages NOT built because the measurement said not to rather than because nobody looked.",
  "THE AXIS FLIPS BY LANGUAGE. German, Italian, French and English search both their own regions and foreign ones. Japanese and Brazilian Portuguese search almost only their own, and the volumes are the largest in the project: kyoto 78,000, hokkaido 44,000, okinawa 41,000, nagano 35,000, shikoku 23,000, cidades de minas gerais 12,000, cidades de santa catarina 7,300, praias de santa catarina 6,800. A single gate keyed on \"region demand\" would have been wrong in both directions."
 ],
 "per_language_refusals_that_matter": {
  "es-ES things_to_do": "REFUSED. que ver en andalucia 30, que ver en cataluna 30, que ver en toscana 20, que ver en la provenza 0. Spanish does not use this shape at region level, and the same market wants pueblos de galicia at 1,400 and playas de galicia at 1,000. The cities and beach shapes pass in Spanish and the things-to-do shape does not.",
  "it-IT best_time": "REFUSED. toscana quando andare 0, sicilia quando andare 30.",
  "fr-FR best_time": "REFUSED. bretagne quand partir 10, toscane quand partir 20.",
  "pt-BR best_time": "REFUSED. melhor epoca para visitar o algarve 0.",
  "de-DE best_time domestic": "bayern beste reisezeit 0 and bayern klima 0, while the same shape for FOREIGN regions passes: andalusien 250, bretagne 200, toskana 150. A German does not ask when to visit Bavaria.",
  "pl-PL and ja-JP and pt-BR foreign regions": "REFUSED at 30 to 70. atrakcje bawarii 30, atrakcje toskanii 50, toscana observed at 150 in Japanese, cidades do algarve 30."
